# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECRETS & PERSONAL DATA — never commit. This repo is PUBLIC.
# (If you ever see one of these staged in `git status`, STOP and unstage it.)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# Local databases & their sidecar files (your health data lives here)
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-journal

# Exports & generated personal-health artifacts (charts, reports, dumps)
exports/
report_preview.png
bedroom_air_vs_sleep.html
# Generated charts/reports tend to contain your data — ignore by default and
# opt-in individually with `git add -f` only after confirming they're safe.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.html
*.csv
# Allow-listed docs/assets that are safe to publish go here as exceptions, e.g.:
# !docs/architecture.png

# Per-developer AI identity (gitignored; copy from .claude-identity.example)
.claude-identity

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Python
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage
.coverage.*

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editor / OS / Claude Code local state
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/settings.local.json
